[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-3) pid=210654, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-3) pid=210654, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \sin^2 \alpha = \sin^2 \left(\frac{\pi}{3}\right) = \sin^2 \left(60^\circ\right) = \left(\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\right)^2 = \frac{3}{4}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-3) pid=210654, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-3) pid=210654, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    Thus,
