[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-3) pid=210654, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \sin^2 \alpha + \sin^2 \beta + \sin^2 \gamma = 3 \times \frac{3}{4} = \frac{9}{4}
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-3) pid=210654, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-3) pid=210654, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-3) pid=210654, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m 6. **Find the maximum value of the sum of the squares of the sides**:
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-3) pid=210654, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \[
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-3) pid=210654, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    a^2 + b^2 + c^2 = 4 \times \frac{9}{4} = 9
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-3) pid=210654, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m    \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-3) pid=210654, ip=10.17.70.33)[0m 
