[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-2) pid=736897)[0m \]
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-2) pid=736897)[0m - The subgroup \( \langle r^2 \rangle = \{ 1, r^2 \} \) is a normal subgroup of \( D_8 \).
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-2) pid=736897)[0m - The subgroup \( \langle r^2, s \rangle = \{ 1, r^2, s, r^2s \} \) is a Hall subgroup of \( D_8 \) because \( | \langle r^2, s \rangle | = 4 \) and \( [D_8 : \langle r^2, s \rangle] = 2 \), and \( \gcd(4, 2) = 2 \neq 1 \).
[36m(MathRuleRewardWorker(reward-math_rule-2) pid=736897)[0m 
